{"id":"646322422ec21b3d","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-laurent-polynomial.md","title":"Laurent Polynomial","display":"df-laurent-polynomial — Laurent Polynomial","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-laurent-polynomial","aliases":["58-df-laurent-polynomial","Laurent Polynomial"],"display":"df-laurent-polynomial — Laurent Polynomial","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-laurent-polynomial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-laurent-polynomial</span><span>Laurent Polynomial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-laurent-polynomial — Laurent Polynomial"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-integer.md\">../batch20/58-df-integer.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomial}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomial}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n\\in V\">\\(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, and Cartesian powers are function-coded: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z^n\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(\\alpha,n,\\mathbb Z)\\}\">\\(\\mathbb Z^n\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(\\alpha,n,\\mathbb Z)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in n\">\\(i\\in n\\)</span>, write <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_i\\coloneqq\\alpha(i)\">\\(\\alpha_i\\coloneqq\\alpha(i)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,0\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\">\\(0_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,0\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\)</span> is the zero exponent vector</li>\n<li>For a set-coded binary operation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star:A\\times A\\to A\">\\(\\star:A\\times A\\to A\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star(u,v)\">\\(\\star(u,v)\\)</span> abbreviates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\">\\(\\star(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum^{+_R,0_R}\">\\(\\sum^{+_R,0_R}\\)</span> denotes the finite fold for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_R\">\\(+_R\\)</span>, with empty value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_R\">\\(0_R\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb Z^n,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb Z^n,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\Bigl\\{f\\in R^{\\mathbb Z^n}:\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land P=\\Bigl\\{f\\in R^{\\mathbb Z^n}:\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}monomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S(m,c,\\eta,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land c\\in R\\land\\eta\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(m,\\mathbb Z^n,R)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\n\\bigl((\\alpha=\\eta\\to m(\\alpha)=c)\n\\land(\\alpha\\neq\\eta\\to m(\\alpha)=0_R)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}monomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S(m,c,\\eta,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land c\\in R\\land\\eta\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(m,\\mathbb Z^n,R)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\n\\bigl((\\alpha=\\eta\\to m(\\alpha)=c)\n\\land(\\alpha\\neq\\eta\\to m(\\alpha)=0_R)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\n(P,+_P,\\cdot_P,0_P,1_P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_P,P\\times P,P)\n\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\n\\bigl(+_P(f,g)(\\alpha)=+_R(f(\\alpha),g(\\alpha))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot_P,P\\times P,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\\Biggl(\n\\cdot_P(f,g)(\\alpha)=\n\\mathop{\\sum\\nolimits^{+_R,0_R}}_{\\substack{\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\\\\nf(\\beta)\\neq0_R,\\ g(\\gamma)\\neq0_R\\\\\n\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\beta_i+\\gamma_i=\\alpha_i)}}\n\\cdot_R(f(\\beta),g(\\gamma))\\Biggr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S(0_P,0_R,0_n,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S(1_P,1_R,0_n,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\n(P,+_P,\\cdot_P,0_P,1_P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_P,P\\times P,P)\n\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\n\\bigl(+_P(f,g)(\\alpha)=+_R(f(\\alpha),g(\\alpha))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot_P,P\\times P,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\\Biggl(\n\\cdot_P(f,g)(\\alpha)=\n\\mathop{\\sum\\nolimits^{+_R,0_R}}_{\\substack{\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\\\\nf(\\beta)\\neq0_R,\\ g(\\gamma)\\neq0_R\\\\\n\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\beta_i+\\gamma_i=\\alpha_i)}}\n\\cdot_R(f(\\beta),g(\\gamma))\\Biggr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S(0_P,0_R,0_n,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S(1_P,1_R,0_n,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\n(P,+_P,\\cdot_P,0_P,1_P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(P,+_P,\\cdot_P,0_P,1_P).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\n(P,+_P,\\cdot_P,0_P,1_P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(P,+_P,\\cdot_P,0_P,1_P).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Laurent polynomial in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> variables is a finite formal sum <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n}c_\\alpha X^\\alpha\">\\(\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n}c_\\alpha X^\\alpha\\)</span>; negative coordinates are allowed, but the coefficient support is finite.</li>\n<li>The convolution sum is finite because it is restricted to the product of the two finite coefficient supports.  This restriction is essential: for fixed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\)</span>, the unrestricted set of decompositions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\beta+\\gamma\">\\(\\alpha=\\beta+\\gamma\\)</span> is infinite.</li>\n<li>Coefficientwise addition and finite-support convolution give the displayed commutative ring.  Associativity and distributivity reduce to finite reindexing, and the zero and unit are the monomials with coefficients <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_R\">\\(0_R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_R\">\\(1_R\\)</span> at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_n\">\\(0_n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Ordinary polynomials use exponent vectors in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>; Laurent-polynomial consumers must not cite that narrower carrier when negative exponents occur.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bourbaki, Algebra</li>\n<li>Atiyah and MacDonald, Commutative Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-integer.md","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomial}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{11}","display":false},{"tex":"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z^n\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(\\alpha,n,\\mathbb Z)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_i\\coloneqq\\alpha(i)","display":false},{"tex":"0_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,0\\rangle:i\\in n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\star:A\\times A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\star(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\star(\\langle u,v\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum^{+_R,0_R}","display":false},{"tex":"+_R","display":false},{"tex":"0_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomial}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb Z^n,R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&\\land P=\\Bigl\\{f\\in R^{\\mathbb Z^n}:\n\\mathrm{Finite}\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n:f(\\alpha)\\neq0_R\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}monomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S(m,c,\\eta,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land c\\in R\\land\\eta\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(m,\\mathbb Z^n,R)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\n\\bigl((\\alpha=\\eta\\to m(\\alpha)=c)\n\\land(\\alpha\\neq\\eta\\to m(\\alpha)=0_R)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\n(P,+_P,\\cdot_P,0_P,1_P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_P,P\\times P,P)\n\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\n\\bigl(+_P(f,g)(\\alpha)=+_R(f(\\alpha),g(\\alpha))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot_P,P\\times P,P)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f,g\\in P\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\;\\Biggl(\n\\cdot_P(f,g)(\\alpha)=\n\\mathop{\\sum\\nolimits^{+_R,0_R}}_{\\substack{\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb Z^n\\\\\nf(\\beta)\\neq0_R,\\ g(\\gamma)\\neq0_R\\\\\n\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\beta_i+\\gamma_i=\\alpha_i)}}\n\\cdot_R(f(\\beta),g(\\gamma))\\Biggr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S(0_P,0_R,0_n,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S(1_P,1_R,0_n,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}laurent\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}ring}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\n(P,+_P,\\cdot_P,0_P,1_P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&\\to\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(P,+_P,\\cdot_P,0_P,1_P).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n}c_\\alpha X^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb Z^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=\\beta+\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"0_R","display":false},{"tex":"1_R","display":false},{"tex":"0_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^n","display":false}],"bytes":4651,"backlinks":[{"id":"dcafe9320aa6f056","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{11}$ and $\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S\\subseteq V^9$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-laurent-polynomial.md]])"},{"id":"4396538a738cd422","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LaurentPolynomialRingStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{11}$ and $\\mathrm{LaurentMonomial}_S\\subseteq V^9$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-laurent-polynomial.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-763","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-laurent-polynomial.md|58-df-laurent-polynomial]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["1c30d21ea7b443f6","36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598","244943f88396309f"]}